### 9. Aislamiento Estricto de Seguridad y Autorización (401 y 403)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9.1 Login con Paciente 2 (Ana Gómez)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "email": "ana.gomez@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordSegura123*"
}

### 9.2 Paciente 2 Intenta Consultar Dispensación de Receta de Paciente 1
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 403 Forbidden (Aislamiento entre pacientes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me/prescriptions/{{recetaPublicId}}/dispensation
Accept: application/json

### 9.3 Paciente Intenta Acceder a la Búsqueda en Ventanilla de Farmacia
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 403 Forbidden (Solo ROLE_FARMACEUTICO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/prescriptions?query=1098765432
Accept: application/json

### 9.4 Paciente Intenta Registrar una Dispensación en Farmacia
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 403 Forbidden (Solo ROLE_FARMACEUTICO)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/dispensations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "recetaPublicId": "{{recetaPublicId}}",
  "sedePublicId": "{{sedePublicId}}",
  "detalles": [
    {
      "medicamentoPublicId": "{{medAmoxiId}}",
      "cantidadEntregada": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 9.5 Administrador Intenta Acceder a Ventanilla de Farmacia
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 403 Forbidden (Segregación de funciones clínicas/farmacéuticas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "email": "admin@meditriaje.com",
  "password": "Admin12345*"
}

GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/prescriptions
Accept: application/json

### 9.6 Profesional Médico Intenta Acceder a Ventanilla de Farmacia
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 403 Forbidden (Médico prescribe, no dispensa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "email": "camilo.torres@meditriaje.com",
  "password": "PasswordSegura123*"
}

GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/prescriptions
Accept: application/json

### 9.7 Solicitud Anónima sin Autenticación
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/prescriptions
Accept: application/json
